    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Wizard is a fast paced medieval hack and slash adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Pixel Wizard - battle hardened and ready for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hordes of enemies like cursed beasts, evil mages, savage bandits and greedy goblins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and fight brutal bosses who lead the hordes across the land in any order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use deadly magic books and scrolls, items and valuable loot to help turn the tide of battle in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free the land of all evil and save the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast paced hack and slash game-play</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use fast and heavy attacks along with a dodge roll to position</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >yourself better to slay your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/025b3494541b1020f4b63ccb9a1548b2.poster.avif?t=1752890779\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/025b3494541b1020f4b63ccb9a1548b2.webm?t=1752890779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/025b3494541b1020f4b63ccb9a1548b2.mp4?t=1752890779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melee and ranged combat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice your enemies up close or shoot fireballs at them from a distance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so you don't get overwhelmed by the hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/854e0785ad484db91b2ce36c116a43a6.poster.avif?t=1752890779\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/854e0785ad484db91b2ce36c116a43a6.webm?t=1752890779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/854e0785ad484db91b2ce36c116a43a6.mp4?t=1752890779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Powerful magic spell books and scrolls</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use magic like force push to push away enemies and possibly trip them over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot powerful heat seeking fireballs that target nearby enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast fireballs that split into many upon contact with anything causing massive damage and chaos!\u2002\u2002\u2002</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/8d6a8105d8eac8663f37105a2dd06f46.poster.avif?t=1752890779\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/8d6a8105d8eac8663f37105a2dd06f46.webm?t=1752890779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/8d6a8105d8eac8663f37105a2dd06f46.mp4?t=1752890779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dangerous and deadly items</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw fire flasks to set enemies on fire but watch out - Wizards are quite flammable!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Poison flasks smell horrid and explode into a noxious gas of green poison clouds smothering your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zap flasks smash into enemies and release powerful bolts of electricity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/d451d9d93b27aeef531f0eeaded3f23b.poster.avif?t=1752890779\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/d451d9d93b27aeef531f0eeaded3f23b.webm?t=1752890779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/d451d9d93b27aeef531f0eeaded3f23b.mp4?t=1752890779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 30 different enemies</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of enemies with some that get close and personal while others are more strategic with distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged enemies will try and keep their distance and if cornered will aggressively attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic enemies have a range of special abilities like teleporting, heat seeking fireballs, magic shields and summoning large objects and creatures that will challenge the player.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Brutal bosses</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evil witch, a destructive bandit leader, a goblin king, a corrupt old wizard and a hefty queen jelly are ready to take out any player that challenges them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive, brutal, fast and with unique abilities these bosses will offer a worthy and sweaty challenge for any player.\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non Linear</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and defeat the bosses in any order that you like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If one boss is too challenging then find and fight another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up, return and try again, coming back stronger than before.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Extras</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Screen shake on - off option</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Xbox controller support</strong></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keyboard rebinding controls</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixel Wizard is a fast paced medieval hack and slash adventure game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Pixel Wizard - battle hardened and ready for combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight hordes of enemies like cursed beasts, evil mages, savage bandits and greedy goblins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and fight brutal bosses who lead the hordes across the land in any order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use deadly magic books and scrolls, items and valuable loot to help turn the tide of battle in your favor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free the land of all evil and save the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast paced hack and slash game-play</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use fast and heavy attacks along with a dodge roll to position</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >yourself better to slay your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/025b3494541b1020f4b63ccb9a1548b2.poster.avif?t=1752890779\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/025b3494541b1020f4b63ccb9a1548b2.webm?t=1752890779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/025b3494541b1020f4b63ccb9a1548b2.mp4?t=1752890779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Melee and ranged combat</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Slice your enemies up close or shoot fireballs at them from a distance</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >so you don't get overwhelmed by the hordes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_i