and explode into a noxious gas of green poison clouds smothering your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zap flasks smash into enemies and release powerful bolts of electricity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/d451d9d93b27aeef531f0eeaded3f23b.poster.avif?t=1752890779\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/d451d9d93b27aeef531f0eeaded3f23b.webm?t=1752890779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3782650/extras/d451d9d93b27aeef531f0eeaded3f23b.mp4?t=1752890779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Over 30 different enemies</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of enemies with some that get close and personal while others are more strategic with distance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ranged enemies will try and keep their distance and if cornered will aggressively attack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Magic enemies have a range of special abilities like teleporting, heat seeking fireballs, magic shields and summoning large objects and creatures that will challenge the player.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Brutal bosses</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An evil witch, a destructive bandit leader, a goblin king, a corrupt old wizard and a hefty queen jelly are ready to take out any player that challenges them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aggressive, brutal, fast and with unique abilities these bosses will offer a worthy and sweaty challenge for any player.\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002\u2002</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Non Linear</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and